# ==============================================================================
# REAL EMAIL DELIVERY CONFIGURATION (GMAIL OR CUSTOM SMTP)
# ==============================================================================
# To receive real verification and OTP emails in your actual email inbox:
#
# OPTION A: Gmail (Recommended - 60 seconds setup)
# 1. Open Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Make sure "2-Step Verification" is ON.
# 3. Search or open "App passwords": https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Name it "Kinly" and click "Create". Google gives you a 16-character code.
# 5. Paste your Gmail and that 16-char code below (remove the '#' in front):
#
# EMAIL_SERVICE=gmail
# EMAIL_USER=yourname@gmail.com
# EMAIL_PASS=abcd efgh ijkl mnop
#
# OPTION B: Custom SMTP (Brevo, Resend, SendGrid, Outlook, AWS SES)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.your-provider.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_smtp_username
# SMTP_PASS=your_smtp_password
# SMTP_FROM="Kinly Family Companion" <noreply@kinly.family>

# ==============================================================================
# GOOGLE OAUTH CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

